      "text": [
        "1107 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «لاَ يَؤُمُّ صَاحِبُ اَلْقَيْدِ اَلْمُطْلَقِينَ وَ لاَ يَؤُمُّ صَاحِبُ اَلْفَالِجِ اَلْأَصِحَّاءَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1107 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"A person in chains (al-qayd) does not lead those who are free, and a person afflicted with paralysis (al-falij) does not lead those who are healthy.\""
        ]
      }
